    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94617" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκᾰφ-εύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφη</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay</i> a person <i>in a
				trough</i> with head, arms, and legs hanging out, and expose
			him in the heat of the sun, until he dies eaten by insects, a
			Persian mode of torture, <i><span class="en">
				Ctes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				29.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				16
			</span></i>.</div>
